5
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪ The furnace refines the empty void ♪

6
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,906
♪ The Way is in mystic fate ♪

7
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪ Be brave enough to split the primal chaos wide open ♪

8
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,596
[Pull Strings]

9
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,500
[Adapted from the novel by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

10
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:42,210
What did you smell?

11
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,686
I smell Changgeng the Great is here.

12
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:45,870
I must have him as my Mentor.

13
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:04,770
Found it.

14
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,536
I still don't know Changgeng's

15
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,010
true appearance,

16
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:11,060
but as long as he is here,

17
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,980
the Pregenesis Sword

18
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:16,100
must be here too.

19
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,010
Elder Kuai Si,

20
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:23,060
it's time to act.

21
00:02:58,150 --> 00:02:59,006
Mentor, what are you doing?

22
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,166
Always so jumpy.

23
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:01,190
What's wrong?

24
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,240
Is that how you talk to your Mentor?

25
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,280
Show some respect.

26
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,060
Mind your tone with your disciple.

27
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:08,216
Next time you speak to your Mentor,

28
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,290
watch it a little.

29
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,776
Stop fidgeting.

30
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,820
What's wrong?

31
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,010
There's a mosquito.

32
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,010
It wasn't this dark earlier.

33
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,840
You kidding me?

34
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,960
So dark in here.

35
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:56,830
Hi.

36
00:04:58,140 --> 00:05:01,076
[Episode 19]

37
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:02,100
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

38
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,020
What are you screaming for?

39
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,630
What's going on?

40
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,870
Possession?

41
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,016
Help! Run!

42
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,696
Hanzhi, go.

43
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,100
Mentor.

44
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:53,810
Pearl Elites, form up.

45
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:03,606
Run.

46
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:04,630
Run.

47
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,220
Xiong Da.

48
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,456
She's up there.

49
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,850
Lingli, run.

50
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,340
It hurts so much.

51
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,240
Stay back.

52
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:34,700
No, don't bite me.

53
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:35,370
No.

54
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:36,510
Don't bite.

55
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,660
Ascendance disciples, fall back.

56
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,240
Can't bite through?

57
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,310
Beat it.

58
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:01,870
Why doesn't it hurt?

59
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:06,540
You even bit my crotch.

60
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,580
So shameless.

61
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:12,100
Brothers, they eat people.

62
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:23,940
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

63
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,250
It's really solid.

64
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:36,430
Impressive.

65
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,480
Who?

66
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,000
3,000 spirit stones.

67
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,136
You Seizing Sect evildoer.

68
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,250
Still trying to trick Ascendance Sect?

69
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,070
Get out!

70
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,480
Just you wait.

71
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,430
What?

72
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,050
What's happening out there?

73
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,250
Xuanya, get inside.

74
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,650
Brat, what's going on?

75
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,600
It's nothing.

76
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:43,846
I heard the sounds of fighting.

77
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:44,870
Let me see.

78
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,460
It's the Demon Clan. A sneak attack.

79
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:47,870
A sneak attack?

80
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:49,390
Don't worry, Yunxiao.

81
00:08:49,790 --> 00:08:51,370
Everything is going as planned.

82
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,220
Just...

83
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,100
It came sooner than I expected.

84
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,766
What about my fellow cultivators?

85
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:57,890
Go away.

86
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,980
They are safe with Zhao Gongming.

87
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,080
Rest assured, Yunxiao.

88
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:06,250
Uncle, run.

89
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,600
What are you doing?

90
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:35,110
Senior is in there. I must save her.

91
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,250
Calm down.

92
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:38,370
You can't save her on your own.

93
00:09:39,270 --> 00:09:40,980
Remember what I told you about hearts?

94
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:42,150
Hearts?

95
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,980
Even the strongest man is futile alone.

96
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:49,180
Only a leader can save everyone.

97
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:51,270
What should I do?

98
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,420
Don't catch me. Run.

99
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:56,700
Brothers, run.

100
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:58,220
Run.

101
00:09:58,510 --> 00:09:59,510
The timing is perfect.

102
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,790
Second Prince,

103
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,056
you have absorbed the Spiritual Power

104
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,220
of half the Mini Realm Scroll.

105
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,060
Ready to test your strength?

106
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,726
Time to turn the tide and make a name.

107
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:20,456
Your Highness,

108
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,526
show your power.

109
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,366
Bring them to heel.

110
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,980
Make them your first followers.

111
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,460
I am Ao Yi, destined to be a light

112
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:31,460
that shines upon the entire East Sea.

113
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,480
Senior.

114
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,300
I will save you.

115
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,650
Transform into a dragon.

116
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:45,890
Run. Keep up.

117
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:47,670
Run.

118
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,600
What is that?

119
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,700
A great Deity.

120
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:54,220
A Deity.

121
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,820
We are saved.

122
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,820
No dragon. Just a worm.

123
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,890
Run that way.

124
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,976
Don't go.

125
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,000
Give me a chance.

126
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,300
Dragon's Prophecy...

127
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,100
Still hasn't recovered.

128
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:26,390
What do we do now?

129
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,370
Seems we need the old way.

130
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:31,670
The old way?

131
00:11:33,870 --> 00:11:34,580
Run.

132
00:11:34,750 --> 00:11:35,750
Keep up.

133
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:37,530
Hurry. Run faster.

134
00:11:58,270 --> 00:11:59,700
So impressive.

135
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:04,180
You absorbed half the scroll's power.

136
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:06,700
Even without transforming, you are still strong.

137
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:11,270
My power

138
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,850
is back.

139
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,850
Isn't he...

140
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,080
The worm from earlier?

141
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:17,890
No wonder he looks familiar.

142
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,600
Sea Deity Sect disciples.

143
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:23,250
Forgot what Sea Deity taught you?

144
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,270
Taught us what?

145
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,010
On my command.

146
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,080
Fire.

147
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,080
Cultivators of Seizing Sect.

148
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:21,250
Why commit such bloodshed?

149
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:23,270
Detached Master,

150
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:27,060
why do you think we came to your sect?

151
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:29,056
With your current cultivation,

152
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:31,460
you must foresee Ascendance Sect's

153
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:33,060
tribulation in 500 years.

154
00:13:34,670 --> 00:13:37,610
How do you know that?

155
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:40,490
But when that tribulation arrives,

156
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:42,250
and we face life or death,

157
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:45,216
I believe the Three Sects here

158
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,980
can put aside the past

159
00:13:47,270 --> 00:13:48,460
and stand as one.

160
00:13:48,790 --> 00:13:51,820
I want to use that tribulation

161
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:55,250
to begin Unity of the Three Sects.

162
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:57,250
You were worried

163
00:13:57,870 --> 00:14:01,060
your sect couldn't survive alone,

164
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,056
so you kept us as a backup plan.

165
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,846
But you didn't know

166
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:07,850
our Seizing Sect is your tribulation.

167
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,246
We came here today

168
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:12,010
to bury Ascendance Sect

169
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,650
along with your dream of unity.

170
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,890
Grandlord.

171
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,120
Grandlord.

172
00:14:27,270 --> 00:14:29,580
Attack!

173
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:03,370
Jiu Jiu is here. Meet your Death!

174
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:06,396
♪ Always a lamp to light the valley ♪

175
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:08,740
♪ Or flying up to the heavens alone ♪

176
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:12,246
♪ To demand justice for the world ♪

177
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:13,270
Backup?

178
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:14,976
Little Uncle.

179
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,986
Charge!

180
00:15:16,010 --> 00:15:19,950
♪ Someone will answer for me ♪

181
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,080
Senior.

182
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:21,886
Thank goodness you're okay.

183
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:22,460
Where is Mentor?

184
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:24,060
He got blown away.

185
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:26,340
♪ Taking our steps together ♪

186
00:15:27,490 --> 00:15:33,550
♪ Fearing no storm or karma ♪

187
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:34,840
Grandlord.

188
00:15:36,410 --> 00:15:37,936
♪ Acting like fierce demons ♪

189
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:38,960
Grandlord.

190
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,420
What's wrong, Grandlord?

191
00:15:43,970 --> 00:15:45,760
♪ Who plots and schemes ♪

192
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:48,520
♪ And set formations in the world ♪

193
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:52,576
♪ I will go in and stir things up ♪

194
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,010
Why isn't Senior back yet?

195
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,060
♪ Amid the clamoring voices ♪

196
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:58,030
Senior.

197
00:15:58,150 --> 00:15:59,700
Senior. I'm so glad you're okay.

198
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:01,246
Saw the fight outside and still ran out?

199
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,830
Copy Scripture of Steadiness 500 times.

200
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,646
I will.

201
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:04,296
Jiu Jiu.

202
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:04,850
Grandlord.

203
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,816
Why are you here?

204
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,606
Over a dozen miles away,

205
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:08,980
a Demon Army is heading this way.

206
00:16:09,270 --> 00:16:11,246
Did Seizing Sect collude with them

207
00:16:11,270 --> 00:16:12,650
to conquer Ascendance Sect?

208
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:14,190
Time to show them what we've got.

209
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:15,610
Disciples, after them.

210
00:16:15,790 --> 00:16:17,060
Capture them all!

211
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:20,870
Here.

212
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,440
Where to?

213
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:24,650
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

214
00:16:26,790 --> 00:16:27,890
Defending Formation.

215
00:16:28,510 --> 00:16:29,510
Open.

216
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:51,300
Elders of all divisions, hold it firmly.

217
00:16:57,830 --> 00:16:58,880
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

218
00:16:58,960 --> 00:16:59,716
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

219
00:16:59,740 --> 00:17:00,370
Grandlord.

220
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:01,246
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

221
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:01,820
Grandlord.

222
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:03,150
Grandlord.

223
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,200
What a pity.

224
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:15,050
We couldn't capture Zhao Gongming.

225
00:17:15,350 --> 00:17:18,090
If we could make him the leader,

226
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:21,250
the story of Seizing Sect's attack

227
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,700
would be much more interesting.

228
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,860
Defending Formation?

229
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,050
Smash it.

230
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,440
Go. Go.

231
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,290
Disciples below Verity Immortal,

232
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,046
shelter in the Hall of Mortal Coils.

233
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,180
Careful.

234
00:17:59,110 --> 00:17:59,900
Go, go, go.

235
00:18:00,030 --> 00:18:01,420
Senior, should we run?

236
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:03,216
Have you reached Verity Immortal?

237
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,856
Not yet.

238
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,046
Then why are you just watching?

239
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:05,656
Run.

240
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,250
Keep up. Be careful.

241
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:24,680
Now that

242
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:26,460
the Grandlord is heavily injured,

243
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:30,010
I am the only Aureate Immortal here.

244
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:33,620
Naturally, I should give the orders.

245
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,040
With the Grandlord absent,

246
00:18:37,310 --> 00:18:38,046
all orders

247
00:18:38,070 --> 00:18:40,050
must be decided by the elders.

248
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,900
This is our sect's tradition.

249
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,160
Kuai Si,

250
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,246
do you want to break the rule?

251
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:47,900
There's no time to debate in crisis.

252
00:18:48,070 --> 00:18:49,420
Do as I say.

253
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:52,046
All elders, lead the disciples

254
00:18:52,070 --> 00:18:53,810
to retreat to Hall of Mortal Coils.

255
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,660
The Grandlord ordered before passing out

256
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:57,616
that we must hold the Defending Formation.

257
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,856
We should stay here

258
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,616
and feed it Spiritual Power.

259
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:03,326
Defend, and Spiritual Power runs dry.

260
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:05,376
Once the formation falls,

261
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,456
and we have no power left,

262
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,806
wouldn't that be suicide?

263
00:19:07,830 --> 00:19:08,616
But the Grandlord said...

264
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,810
The Grandlord?

265
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,856
The Seizing Sect broke in

266
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,616
because the Grandlord messed up.

267
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,046
He let them into Ascendance Sect.

268
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:15,456
You...

269
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,246
That's true.

270
00:19:16,270 --> 00:19:18,660
Our sect has been in total chaos

271
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:21,420
because the Grandlord allowed it.

272
00:19:22,070 --> 00:19:24,220
The Elucidating guests fled the crisis.

273
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:26,416
And the Seizing disciples had schemes.

274
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,860
There is absolutely no honor

275
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,896
among these Three Sects.

276
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:30,290
You all...

277
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,246
He's right.

278
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:34,050
Please, Elders,

279
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:37,140
retreat to Hall of Mortal Coils now.

280
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,246
Do not delay.

281
00:19:38,270 --> 00:19:38,726
Yes.

282
00:19:38,750 --> 00:19:39,750
Wait.

283
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:42,460
If Seizing Sect and Demon Army attack,

284
00:19:42,790 --> 00:19:44,420
what about the other divisions?

285
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:50,420
Then those divisions can only blame

286
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:53,860
their ill fortune.

287
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,920
Move aside.

288
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,570
Make way. All of you.

289
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:57,620
Move.

290
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:58,456
Grandlord.

291
00:19:58,480 --> 00:19:59,480
Grandlord.

292
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:02,200
Grandlord.

293
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:03,590
Grandlord.

294
