I'm even willing to die.

585
00:36:36,630 --> 00:36:38,566
Please undo the spell.

586
00:36:38,590 --> 00:36:40,256
I want to hear what Senior said.

587
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:42,210
I want to hear her voice.

588
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,820
Do you want to know

589
00:36:45,230 --> 00:36:47,256
what she actually said to you?

590
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:47,936
Yes.

591
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,900
Yes. Yes.

592
00:36:51,190 --> 00:36:53,490
Just let Li Changshou

593
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:56,740
enter the Mini Realm Scroll,

594
00:36:58,670 --> 00:37:01,690
and I'll undo this Silencing Spell.

595
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:09,840
Fine!

596
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:10,940
Fine.

597
00:37:11,320 --> 00:37:12,610
Fine. Kuai Si.

598
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:13,880
Hurry and undo it.

599
00:37:14,030 --> 00:37:14,936
Please undo it now.

600
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:16,610
Please. I'm begging you.

601
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:18,416
Please. I'm begging you.

602
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:19,980
Kuai Si.

603
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:20,976
Please undo it.

604
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:22,530
Kuai Si, I beg you.

605
00:37:39,960 --> 00:37:40,960
Senior.

606
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:45,380
Wanna know where she actually went?

607
00:37:45,510 --> 00:37:47,860
Let me tell you.

608
00:38:03,710 --> 00:38:04,780
Kuai Si.

609
00:38:07,030 --> 00:38:08,030
Senior.

610
00:38:12,510 --> 00:38:15,130
What did you do to this talisman?

611
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:19,300
This talisman

612
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:23,690
was indeed left by Wan Jiangyu.

613
00:38:29,710 --> 00:38:30,710
However,

614
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:34,380
I didn't find it in the South Sea.

615
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:38,530
It was in Kuru Land.

616
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:42,210
When I killed her.

617
00:38:45,710 --> 00:38:46,710
Back then,

618
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:48,740
you were a perfect couple.

619
00:38:49,110 --> 00:38:50,530
Envied by everyone.

620
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,130
But she was so beautiful,

621
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:55,170
you weren't the only one

622
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:57,530
who fell for her.

623
00:38:59,230 --> 00:39:00,230
Junior.

624
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:03,960
Why?

625
00:39:04,760 --> 00:39:07,490
Why did she love only you?

626
00:39:07,630 --> 00:39:09,690
Only you, Qi Yuan.

627
00:39:10,230 --> 00:39:12,690
Why wouldn't she even look at me?

628
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:20,840
Senior.

629
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,170
What makes you so special?

630
00:39:27,510 --> 00:39:29,740
Why you? Why?

631
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,900
I thought if I ruined you,

632
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:36,090
she'd finally look at me.

633
00:39:36,400 --> 00:39:37,740
But I never expected

634
00:39:38,590 --> 00:39:40,090
she would leave Ascendance Sect

635
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:43,090
just to save you.

636
00:39:45,230 --> 00:39:47,420
For a useless waste like you.

637
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:51,420
She went into danger in North Land.

638
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,380
Just for a waste like you!

639
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:57,980
I hated her for that.

640
00:39:59,070 --> 00:40:00,650
So I followed her

641
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:02,860
all the way to North Land.

642
00:40:08,630 --> 00:40:10,650
I lured a fierce beast

643
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,690
to attack her.

644
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:33,896
Senior, are you okay?

645
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:36,980
Kuai Si, why are you here?

646
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:39,340
Don't try to talk. I'll get you out.

647
00:40:39,760 --> 00:40:40,760
Come on.

648
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:42,420
I won't make it.

649
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:46,050
There's something.

650
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:47,980
I'd like to ask you.

651
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:51,300
Please take this Jade Talisman

652
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,740
back to Ascendance Sect

653
00:40:54,360 --> 00:40:55,980
and give it to Qi Yuan.

654
00:40:57,230 --> 00:41:00,490
I have so much to tell him.

655
00:41:01,190 --> 00:41:04,530
It's all in the Jade Talisman.

656
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:13,090
It's for Qi Yuan?

657
00:41:14,030 --> 00:41:15,050
Please.

658
00:41:15,880 --> 00:41:17,380
Give it to Qi Yuan.

659
00:41:32,110 --> 00:41:33,110
Okay.

660
00:41:34,190 --> 00:41:35,190
Senior.

661
00:41:36,550 --> 00:41:37,550
I promise.

662
00:41:39,190 --> 00:41:41,690
I'll surely give it to Qi Yuan.

663
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:44,980
All these years,

664
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:49,170
you've been waiting for her like a fool.

665
00:41:49,550 --> 00:41:50,550
Actually,

666
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:54,980
she died at my hand long ago.

667
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:01,940
Qi Yuan.

668
00:42:03,190 --> 00:42:07,650
Watching you suffer love sickness daily,

669
00:42:08,150 --> 00:42:11,260
it just makes me happy.

670
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:24,090
Resentment

671
00:42:24,630 --> 00:42:28,530
is the finest weapon in this world.

672
